Package: Regrans
Title: Segmented Linear Regression Models
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Rodrigo", family = "Sant'Ana",
           email = "rsantana@univali.br", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = "Fernando de Pol", family = "Mayer",
           email = "fernando.mayer@ufpr.br", role = "ctb"),
    person(given = "Paulo Ricardo", family = "Pezzuto",
           email = "pezzuto@univali.br", role = "aut"),
    person(given = "Rafael Mota", family = "Alves",
           email = "rafaelmotaalves.sc@gmail.com", role = "aut"))
Description: Fits one-transition segmented linear regressions with either two
    independent lines or a continuous hinge. Selects the transition by
    minimizing residual sum of squares and includes a single-line reference
    fit, tabular summaries, and editable plots.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    generics,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    tibble
Suggests:
    broom,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
